--
--   Description
----------------
--
-- This tests is based on tx_random_with_ext_fifo_frames test 
-- with the addition of sending tx frames into the fifo port and 
-- underrrun frame into tx fifo interface
--
--
-- Functional Coverage
----------------------
-- This tests basic transmit functionality using random length buffers
-- at random locations for DMA frames and fixed data from FIFO frames
--
-- DMA frames are sent on different queue so that the DMA and FIFO frames
-- order can be checked independantly. 
-- 
--
-- Detailed Test Description
----------------------------
--
-- Enable transmit and interrupts, write transmit address and
-- control registers.
--
-- Supply transmit data to the AHB interface and check the
-- transmitted data, pad and crc.
--
-- Supply data to the tx fifo interface. 
--
-- On reception of the transmit complete interrupt check the
-- interrupt and transmit status registers and the statistics
-- registers for the DMA frames but only statistics for FIFO
-- frames.
--
-- Enable transmit and interrupts, write transmit address and
-- control registers.
--
-- Check stats after time out
--
